error[type]: `json.parse` cannot decode `Blob`: field `data` has type `Bytes`, which has no decoder
 --> main.silt:16:28
    |
 16 |   let _ = generic.fetch(s, Blob)
    |                            ^^^^ `json.parse` cannot decode `Blob`: field `data` has type `Bytes`, which has no decoder
  = note: `generic.fetch` passes it to `json.parse`
  = help: decodable field types are Int, Float, String, Bool, Date, Time, DateTime, json.Value, List(T), Option(T), Map(String, T), tuples, non-generic record and enum types, types with a `json.Decode` impl, and aliases of these
